        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "APP Kirrane Auctioneering are delighted to offer to the market this guilt edged investment opportunity. Located in the heart of Kilkelly and within walking distance of all amenities this stunning property offers a unique investment opportunity. \n\nThe property is consisting of three apartments. All fully furnished and with sitting tenants. The units have been finished to a very high standard recently renovated. All tenants are registered with RTB. The property is fire compliant. The block comes with a yield of 11 percent gross passing rent. \n\nApartment one is a One bedroom ground floor apartment with private front door access. The property briefly consists of:\nOpen plan kitchen, living dining area with timber and tiled flooring, modern kitchen and good quality appliances. Modern bathroom fully tiled and fitted with white bathroom ware. Double bedroom offering timber flooring, fitted wardrobes, curtain pole and nicely painted, Fitted with electric heating. The property consists of 500 sq. ft approximately and offers a C2 Building Energy Rating Certificate. \n\nApartment two consists of a two bedroom apartment located on the ground floor with side door access. Offering 665 sq ft accommodation approximately. Building Energy Rating of D1. Beautifully presented and offering an open plan kitchen, living and dining area fitted with modern kitchen and good quality appliances. Two double bedrooms with timber flooring, curtain poles, fitted wardrobes and nicely painted. Large fully tiled bathroom with white bathroom ware installed. \n\nApartment three is a three bedroom large apartment on the first floor. Consisting of 1235 sq. ft approximately and offers spacious living and sleeping accommodation. Private access with carpet staircase. Open plan kitchen, living and dining area. Modern kitchen installed offering ample worktop and storage space. Large fully tiled bathroom and fitted with white bathroom ware. Attention to detail throughout. The Building Energy Rating for this apartment is C1. \n\nAll apartments are rented with a passing rent of 28,080 p.a. to increase to 28,680 in November 2026. \n\nFor further information or to arrange viewing please make contact with the Sole Selling Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering \"we don`t just list properties we sell them\". All offers and negotiation go through the Agents APP Kirrane Auctioneering. \n\nEircode F35 HR53\nEircode F35 FK50\nEircode F35 HK71\nMains water, mains sewage, electricity connected, broadband and phone service available in the area.\n\nPlease note: These particulars are for general information only for this property. The details contained are not to be relied upon as statements or the vendor or representation of fact. Whilst every care is taken in the preparation of the property details, neither APP Kirrane Auctioneering or the vendor or the vendor accept any liability for the details contained in the description of the property. The interested persons must satisfy themselves by viewing the property or employ to inspect the property on their behalf. No Auctioneer or Staff Member employed by APP Kirrane Auctioneering in either Main Street, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo or Bohermore, Galway has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.\n\n"
      },
